---
import DemoLayout from '@/layouts/DemoLayout.astro';
import Header from './_components/Header.astro';
import Footer from './_components/Footer.astro';
import Flower from './_components/Flower.astro';
import './_components/theme.css';
export const prerender = true;
---
<DemoLayout demoSlug="mogra-house" title="Our house — Comfort, care & useful notes | Mogra House" description="The fictional Pune beauty house's approach to a thoughtful appointment, with clear comfort preferences and practical visit notes." fontsHref="/fonts/demos/mogra-house/fonts.css" themeColor="#f7ede7"><div class="mogra"><Header active="house"/><main><section class="mh-wrap mh-detail-hero"><div><p class="mh-kicker">The idea of Mogra / Pune</p><h1>A softer kind<br/><em>of getting ready.</em></h1><p>Mogra is a small flower with a generous presence. This imagined beauty house takes that as its starting point: little gestures that change the feel of a day.</p><p>No transformation manifesto. Just a comfortable chair, an honest menu and a conversation about what feels right for you.</p></div><div class="mh-house-art reveal"><Flower id="about" colour="#d5c4e6"/></div></section><section class="mh-wrap mh-section mh-values">{[['Your pace','A quiet appointment is a complete appointment. Ask for less conversation, a pause between services or a little more explanation before a step begins.'],['Your preferences','Share fragrance sensitivities, comfort preferences and what you want to skip. The actual provider should explain suitable products and alternatives before starting.'],['Your clarity','A real service should begin with a confirmed price, time estimate and scope. Longer hair, colour correction and additional treatments should be discussed before being added.']].map(([t,p])=><article class="reveal"><h2 style="font-size:40px">{t}</h2><p>{p}</p></article>)}</section><section class="mh-wrap mh-section mh-faq"><p class="mh-kicker">A few house notes</p><h2>Before you settle in.</h2><details><summary>Is Mogra House a real salon?</summary><p>No. It is a fictional Pune salon and spa concept. There is no physical address, staff roster or real appointment availability. Website enquiries go to ATITTLE.</p></details><details><summary>What is included in the sample prices?</summary><p>The menu describes each service’s included steps. Prices include assumed taxes and use a single starting scope; colour, hair length and additional work would need a real quotation.</p></details><details><summary>How should I prepare for a colour appointment?</summary><p>Discuss your colour history and desired result with the real salon first. Follow its consultation and product testing instructions; the planner does not check suitability.</p></details><details><summary>Can I ask for a quiet or fragrance-conscious visit?</summary><p>Absolutely worth discussing with your chosen provider before booking. This fictional house illustrates those preferences but cannot confirm any real facilities or product availability.</p></details><details><summary>Can I book or pay here?</summary><p>No bookings or payments are accepted. The visit planner only calculates a sample itinerary on your device. The enquiry link opens ATITTLE’s real website contact flow.</p></details></section></main><Footer/></div></DemoLayout>
